### Page 1 of 2

```text
2101 O’Neil Ave., Suite 205 · Cheyenne · Wyoming
Phone 307.637.6299  ·  Fax 307.637.6308
www.plancheyenne.org

MEMO

TO:
Mayor and City Council Members
FROM:
Tom Mason - Director Cheyenne MPO
DATE:
November 4, 2015
SUBJECT:
Official Map Ordinance Amendment
______________________________________________________________________________

At the Public Service Committee on November 3, 2015 I provided an amendment to the Major
Street Plan Official Map.  I had discovered that morning that a surveyed centerline for a future
road extension from past Master Plans was not on the proposed map.  The future road was the
extension of Morrie/Airport Parkway to the Dell Range and Powderhouse intersection.

I ask that an amendment by substitute map be made which will add that corridor line with the
following text:

The Official Map Amendment for “Morrie Avenue Extension Runway 8/26
Underpass” between Airport Parkway and Dell Range Blvd was approved by
Ordinance No. 3279 on May 13, 1996. However, the 2014 Master Transportation
Plan (PlanCheyenne) did not include this extension.

A substitute map, Sheet #1 is provided with the addition.
```

